  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#1",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "After forty-eight hours of searching, she walked into the interrogation room on her own two feet.",
      "source": "1.08#9",
      "bg": "interrogation_gypsy",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#2",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "The American public feared that a ruthless killer had abducted a severely disabled teenage girl.",
      "source": "1.11#1",
      "bg": "crowd_house",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#3",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "D",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.7,
      "text": "But the moment that door opened, our entire perception completely collapsed.",
      "source": "1.11#2",
      "bg": "interrogation_gypsy",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#4",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "D",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Gypsy Rose Blanchard was not in a wheelchair at all.",
      "source": "1.11#3",
      "bg": "interrogation_gypsy",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#5",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "D",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "She walked firmly on her own legs, with completely normal composure.",
      "source": "1.11#4",
      "bg": "interrogation_gypsy",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#6",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "From this moment, criminal psychology distinguishes two concepts: modus operandi and psychological signature.",
      "source": "2.07#1",
      "bg": "brain_desk",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#7",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Modus operandi is what an offender does to execute the act and evade punishment.",
      "source": "2.07#2",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#8",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Here, the MO was constantly evolving: changing hospitals and relocating homes whenever a doctor grew suspicious.",
      "source": "2.07#3",
      "bg": "pinboard",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#9",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "A psychological signature is immutable, born to satisfy core pathological emotional needs.",
      "source": "2.07#7",
      "bg": "brain_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#10",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Her signature was stripping away adulthood: falsifying birth records, keeping a twenty-year-old daughter legally frozen as a sixteen-year-old child.",
      "source": "2.07#9",
      "bg": "doll",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#11",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "speed": -0.04,
      "pause_after": 0.7,
      "text": "She didn't just want her child to be sick. She wanted her child to never grow up.",
      "source": "2.07#11",
      "bg": "spotlight_deedee",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK1.01#12",
      "clip": "TK1",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.0,
      "text": "Episode one of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
      "source": "CTA",
      "bg": "podcast_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#1",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "N2",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "text": "For decades, in front of hundreds of doctors, nurses, police officers, and charity volunteers, she never once leaped out of her wheelchair to cry for help.",
      "source": "4.03#4",
      "bg": "wheelchair_room",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#2",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "To understand why, we must examine two mechanisms of psychological confinement: learned helplessness and trauma bonding.",
      "source": "4.05#2",
      "bg": "brain_desk",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#3",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "In 1967, psychologist Martin Seligman published his classic experiment on learned helplessness.",
      "source": "4.07#1",
      "bg": "cage",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#4",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.04,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "text": "When subjects are trapped in an enclosed chamber and subjected to unavoidable electric shocks, after repeated failed attempts to resist, they completely surrender their will to fight.",
      "source": "4.07#2",
      "bg": "cage",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#5",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Even when the cage doors are thrown wide open and the electric currents cease, the subject remains lying motionless in submission.",
      "source": "4.07#3",
      "bg": "cage_open",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#6",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "A profoundly traumatized mind arrives at a rigid conclusion: all resistance is futile.",
      "source": "4.07#5",
      "bg": "brain_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#7",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Whenever the daughter sat before doctors, her mother's hand held hers tightly. Outsiders thought it was a touch filled with tender love.",
      "source": "4.07#7",
      "bg": "hands",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#8",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "To the young girl, it was an explicit threat: if she said one wrong word, her mother's hand would squeeze until bruised.",
      "source": "4.07#8",
      "bg": "hands",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#9",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "That is precisely how a child learns that resistance is completely useless.",
      "source": "4.07#8",
      "bg": "cage_open",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK2.01#10",
      "clip": "TK2",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.0,
      "text": "Episode one of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
      "source": "CTA",
      "bg": "podcast_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#1",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "text": "Many believe she did it all simply for welfare checks and free trips to Disneyland.",
      "source": "3.02#3",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#2",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "But if it were solely driven by financial greed, an offender would choose schemes far less exhausting and hazardous.",
      "source": "3.02#4",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#3",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "According to the DSM-5-TR manual, FDIA is fundamentally distinct from malingering.",
      "source": "3.04#1",
      "bg": "brain_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#4",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "A malingerer fakes illness to acquire financial gain, quietly indulging in the shadows.",
      "source": "3.04#2",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#5",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "But an individual with FDIA hungers for a far more potent narcotic: narcissistic supply.",
      "source": "3.04#3",
      "bg": "spotlight_deedee",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#6",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Before having a child, her life was a cascade of failures: estranged by family, her marriage collapsing at age twenty-four.",
      "source": "3.05#2",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#7",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "But the moment she donned the identity of a resilient single mother caring for a critically ill child, her entire universe shifted.",
      "source": "3.05#4",
      "bg": "spotlight_deedee",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#8",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Every piece of praise hailing her as the greatest mother was an instant dose of dopamine delivered straight to her brain.",
      "source": "3.05#7",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#9",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "N1",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "We truly believed she was a living saint walking among us.",
      "source": "1.07#6",
      "bg": "house_night",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK3.01#10",
      "clip": "TK3",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.0,
      "text": "Episode one of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary via the link in our bio.",
      "source": "CTA",
      "bg": "podcast_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#1",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.4,
      "text": "Four survival red flags to recognize a child being made sick inside their own home.",
      "source": "5.04#3",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "pull"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#2",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "From psychological and clinical viewpoints, communities must pay urgent attention to the first two early warnings.",
      "source": "5.04#3",
      "bg": "clinical",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#3",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Red flag number one: unusually convoluted medical histories that contradict objective laboratory findings. An endless list of severe illnesses, yet diagnostic results remain normal or directly contradict the caregiver's claims.",
      "source": "5.05#1",
      "bg": "records",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#4",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "C",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Red flag number two: symptoms manifest exclusively in the presence of the caregiver, and vanish rapidly when the patient is separated or placed under independent monitoring.",
      "source": "5.05#2",
      "bg": "clinical",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#5",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "D",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.5,
      "text": "Red flag number three: chronic doctor shopping and attention addiction. The caregiver immediately switches clinics whenever questioned, while constantly parading the child's illness on social media for public pity.",
      "source": "5.05#3",
      "bg": "pinboard",
      "motion": "pan"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#6",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "D",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.03,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "Red flag number four: absolute social isolation. The victim is severed from schools, peers, and extended family, under the noble pretext of safeguarding fragile health.",
      "source": "5.05#4",
      "bg": "crowd_away",
      "motion": "push"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#7",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.6,
      "text": "These four indicators extend far beyond a single case file. They are crucial knowledge for society to protect vulnerable children.",
      "source": "5.06#2",
      "bg": "two_shadows",
      "motion": "still"
    },
    {
      "id": "TK4.01#8",
      "clip": "TK4",
      "role": "H",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "speed": -0.02,
      "pause_after": 0.0,
      "text": "Save this video. Watch the full episode one documentary via the link in our bio.",
      "source": "CTA",
      "bg": "podcast_desk",
      "motion": "still"
    }
  ]
